{"id": "youth-justice-same-money-fewer-days", "title": "Youth justice reports: one program’s count made the days collapse", "seconds": 136.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "713b3227b06442f0", "words": 448, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["oneLine", "suspicious[0]", "links[0]"], "text": "Two years of youth justice programs. The same money: 13.1 million dollars, each year.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.88, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Justice Services spending, 2024-25", "$13.1 million"], "b": ["Justice Services spending, 2025-26", "$13.1 million"], "arrows": false}, "emph": ["same money"], "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.4, 0.5, 0.68, 1.0, 1.68, 1.84, 2.1, 2.68, 3.07, 3.32, 3.5, 3.78, 4.24, 4.45]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "links[1]"], "text": "Days of service: 194,889. Then, 36,382.", "t0": 5.0, "t1": 11.31, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["participant service days, 2024-25", "194,889"], "b": ["participant service days, 2025-26", "36,382"]}, "emph": ["36,382"], "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.33, 1.03, 1.22, 1.48, 2.02, 2.43, 2.58, 2.84, 3.71, 4.36, 4.93, 5.31, 5.56, 5.81]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "It’s a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 11.83, "t1": 12.97, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.27, 0.55, 0.69, 0.76]}, {"scene": "setup", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "The Department of Children, Youth and Their Families pays nonprofits to run programs for young people.", "t0": 13.19, "t1": 17.55, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Children, Youth and Their Families", "kicker": "The youth department", "sub": "year-end reports by service area"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.48, 0.57, 1.09, 1.34, 1.42, 1.6, 2.22, 2.48, 3.04, 3.15, 3.35, 3.75, 3.89, 4.06]}, {"scene": "setup", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Justice Services covers life coaching, diversion, placement and re-entry.", "t0": 17.67, "t1": 21.1, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Children, Youth and Their Families", "kicker": "The youth department", "sub": "year-end reports by service area"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.78, 1.09, 1.3, 1.79, 2.38, 2.79, 2.94]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Days of service fell 81 percent.", "t0": 21.32, "t1": 22.84, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["81%", "fewer", "days"], "sub": "Justice Services, 2024-25 to 2025-26"}, "emph": ["81 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.3, 0.61, 0.79, 1.17]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "The young people served barely moved: 1,179, then 1,126.", "t0": 22.96, "t1": 28.43, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["81%", "fewer", "days"], "sub": "Justice Services, 2024-25 to 2025-26"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.28, 0.54, 0.96, 1.29, 2.05, 2.62, 2.84, 3.72, 3.96, 4.16, 4.52, 4.67, 4.88]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "The department’s grantee pages trace that fall to one program.", "t0": 28.55, "t1": 31.18, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Grantee pages", "kicker": "The grantee pages", "sub": "saved for all 33 Justice Services programs, both years"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.51, 0.89, 1.24, 1.51, 1.67, 1.91, 2.03, 2.19]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "links[1]"], "text": "Community Youth Center of San Francisco’s School Violence Interrupters", "t0": 31.3, "t1": 34.42, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "163,663", "label": "days reported by one program, 2024-25", "sub": "Community Youth Center of San Francisco, School Violence Interrupters"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.67, 0.93, 1.03, 1.2, 1.74, 2.02, 2.37]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "links[1]"], "text": "reported 163,663 days in 2024-25.", "t0": 34.42, "t1": 39.48, "shot": "b8x", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "163,663", "label": "days reported by one program, 2024-25", "sub": "Community Youth Center of San Francisco, School Violence Interrupters"}, "emph": ["163,663"], "wt": [0.04, 0.45, 0.62, 0.87, 1.4, 1.8, 2.01, 2.27, 2.8, 3.11, 3.2, 3.48, 4.29, 4.44]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "timeline[1]"], "text": "That was 84 percent of the whole service area. The next year: 943.", "t0": 39.6, "t1": 44.09, "shot": "b8b", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["that program, 2024-25", "163,663 days"], "b": ["2025-26", "943 days"]}, "emph": ["84 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.28, 0.69, 0.99, 1.05, 1.16, 1.37, 1.7, 2.49, 2.61, 2.82, 3.5, 3.71, 3.95]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Its page shows 126 service dates and 26 school incidents.", "t0": 44.21, "t1": 47.57, "shot": "b8c", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "School Violence Interrupters, 2024-25", "sub": "its own page", "rows": [["Service dates", "126"], ["School incidents", "26"], ["Participant days per service date", "about 1,299", 1]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.42, 0.69, 0.84, 1.04, 1.5, 1.81, 2.14, 2.3, 2.72, 2.96]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "trajectory", "links[2]"], "text": "Without that program, days rose 13 percent,", "t0": 47.69, "t1": 50.26, "shot": "b8d", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["every other program, 2024-25", "31,226 days"], "b": ["2025-26", "35,439 days"], "kicker": "Without that one program"}, "emph": ["13 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.45, 1.12, 1.39, 1.64, 2.0]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "trajectory", "links[2]"], "text": "from 31,226 to 35,439.", "t0": 50.26, "t1": 54.39, "shot": "b8dx", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["every other program, 2024-25", "31,226 days"], "b": ["2025-26", "35,439 days"], "kicker": "Without that one program"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.66, 0.99, 1.18, 1.4, 2.13, 2.28, 2.83, 3.17, 3.38, 3.6]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["innocent[3]"], "text": "Its page notes the grantee was not required to report participant-level data, across seven sites.", "t0": 54.51, "t1": 58.8, "shot": "b8n", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Grantee was not required to report participant-level data"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.43, 0.64, 0.73, 1.12, 1.27, 1.43, 1.8, 1.9, 2.21, 2.95, 3.33, 3.67, 3.94]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[6]", "innocent[1]"], "text": "Counting every student reached at a campus event could honestly give a big number.", "t0": 58.92, "t1": 61.98, "shot": "b8e", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The open question is how a figure that made up most of a published total was counted, and whether anyone checked it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.54, 0.89, 1.13, 1.22, 1.29, 1.63, 1.89, 2.03, 2.36, 2.52, 2.59, 2.77]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[6]", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "The page gives no method. So the question is how it was counted, and whether anyone checked.", "t0": 62.1, "t1": 66.36, "shot": "b8e", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The open question is how a figure that made up most of a published total was counted, and whether anyone checked it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.4, 0.63, 0.81, 1.45, 1.61, 1.72, 2.1, 2.27, 2.44, 2.52, 2.65, 3.08, 3.29, 3.6, 3.95]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "share", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2025-26, programs met 45 percent of their outcome targets.", "t0": 66.58, "t1": 70.85, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "share", "pct": 45, "label": "of outcome targets met, 2025-26, across 255 programs"}, "emph": ["45 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.37, 0.87, 0.94, 1.84, 2.3, 2.52, 3.02, 3.36, 3.42, 3.58, 3.89]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[1]"], "text": "34 of 215 programs fell short of their participant target.", "t0": 70.97, "t1": 74.15, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "34", "label": "of 215 programs fell short of their participant target", "sub": "181 met it"}, "emph": ["34"], "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.53, 0.69, 0.91, 1.32, 1.76, 1.97, 2.18, 2.25, 2.37, 2.83]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[2]"], "text": "4 program-years missed a required narrative report, and 26 had no performance measures.", "t0": 74.27, "t1": 78.5, "shot": "b11b", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["program-years missing a required narrative report", "4"], "b": ["program-years with no performance measures", "26"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.86, 1.05, 1.13, 1.53, 1.84, 2.39, 2.55, 3.1, 3.29, 3.44, 3.86]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "Where reports aren’t filed and surveys show no data, nothing outside the grantee explains the results.", "t0": 78.62, "t1": 82.97, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Where narrative reports are not filed and survey targets show no data, nothing outside the grantee explains the results."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.49, 0.69, 0.98, 1.09, 1.43, 1.65, 1.8, 2.33, 2.61, 2.98, 3.08, 3.44, 3.83, 3.93]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "One more check: the City’s payment table.", "t0": 83.19, "t1": 85.1, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "City payment table", "sub": "Department code CHF", "rows": [["Paid by the department, 2025-26", "$139.8 million", 1]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.36, 0.95, 1.07, 1.33, 1.62]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "It shows the department paying 139.8 million dollars in 2025-26.", "t0": 85.22, "t1": 90.0, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "City payment table", "sub": "Department code CHF", "rows": [["Paid by the department, 2025-26", "$139.8 million", 1]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.39, 0.48, 0.87, 1.12, 1.28, 1.51, 2.01, 2.24, 2.42, 2.73, 3.1, 3.24, 3.53, 4.07, 4.15]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The year-end reports account for 104.1 million.", "t0": 90.12, "t1": 93.06, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["spent, as the year-end reports account for it", "$104.1 million"], "b": ["paid by the department", "$139.8 million"], "arrows": false}, "emph": ["104.1 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.47, 0.82, 1.1, 1.25, 1.49, 1.83, 2.08, 2.36, 2.59]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "share", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "About 74 percent.", "t0": 93.18, "t1": 94.22, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "share", "pct": 74, "label": "of the department’s payments the reports cover, 2025-26"}, "emph": ["74 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.7]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "Most of the rest went to the school district, 19.6 million dollars, and City College.", "t0": 94.34, "t1": 98.53, "shot": "b15b", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["school district, 2025-26", "$19,600,360"], "b": ["City College, 2025-26", "$9,455,932"], "arrows": false, "kicker": "Most of the rest"}, "emph": ["19.6 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.3, 0.41, 0.62, 0.78, 0.87, 0.95, 1.21, 1.78, 2.14, 2.39, 2.6, 2.85, 3.34, 3.55, 3.78]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "innocent[3]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Those would not appear in grantee reports, which list no payees: the match is by amount.", "t0": 98.65, "t1": 102.53, "shot": "b15b", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["school district, 2025-26", "$19,600,360"], "b": ["City College, 2025-26", "$9,455,932"], "arrows": false, "kicker": "Most of the rest"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.34, 0.48, 0.74, 0.81, 1.17, 1.67, 1.9, 2.14, 2.3, 2.9, 3.07, 3.3, 3.41, 3.59]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "suspicious[3].what"], "text": "In another service area, one recess program", "t0": 102.65, "t1": 104.8, "shot": "b15c", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "479,298", "label": "participant days from one recess program, 2025-26", "sub": "Playworks: 181 participants, 193 service dates"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.42, 0.74, 1.26, 1.48, 1.83]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "suspicious[3].what"], "text": "reported 479,298 days from 181 participants.", "t0": 104.8, "t1": 109.2, "shot": "b15c", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "479,298", "label": "participant days from one recess program, 2025-26", "sub": "Playworks: 181 participants, 193 service dates"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.4, 0.64, 0.93, 1.47, 1.83, 1.99, 2.24, 2.65, 2.92, 3.09, 3.21, 3.43, 3.81]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what"], "text": "That is 18 percent of all the department’s days.", "t0": 109.32, "t1": 111.45, "shot": "b15c", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "479,298", "label": "participant days from one recess program, 2025-26", "sub": "Playworks: 181 participants, 193 service dates"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.28, 0.6, 0.95, 1.04, 1.19, 1.28, 1.72]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "On its 2024-29 agreements, the City paid no grantee more than its pages report spending.", "t0": 111.57, "t1": 116.66, "shot": "b15d", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["paid on 2024-29 agreements, fiscal 2025-26", "$178.7 million"], "b": ["spending the pages report, 2024-26", "$208.8 million"], "arrows": false}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.27, 0.53, 1.05, 1.15, 1.62, 2.31, 2.44, 2.7, 2.97, 3.15, 3.63, 3.8, 3.94, 4.07, 4.4, 4.69]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "innocent[0]"], "text": "The records don’t show services were cut, or money misspent.", "t0": 116.88, "t1": 119.65, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That services were cut or money misspent", "How the 163,663 days were counted, and whether anyone checked"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.39, 0.59, 0.82, 1.19, 1.33, 1.79, 2.01, 2.25]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]"], "text": "Or how the 163,663 days were counted, and whether the department checked them.", "t0": 119.77, "t1": 124.89, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That services were cut or money misspent", "How the 163,663 days were counted, and whether anyone checked"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.3, 0.42, 0.57, 0.87, 1.37, 1.74, 1.94, 2.19, 2.7, 2.94, 3.07, 3.69, 3.87, 4.13, 4.23, 4.68, 4.92]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? How that program counted days, and whether the definition of a day changed.", "t0": 125.01, "t1": 129.59, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "How School Violence Interrupters counted participant days in 2024-25"}, {"who": "", "what": "Whether the definition of a participant service day changed"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.31, 0.57, 1.11, 1.31, 1.47, 1.89, 2.2, 2.68, 2.84, 3.11, 3.22, 3.73, 3.84, 3.92, 4.13]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "suspicious[0].why", "defense[0]"], "text": "The department published both figures without comment, and no program is accused.", "t0": 129.71, "t1": 132.97, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.52, 0.82, 1.03, 1.31, 1.56, 2.05, 2.22, 2.38, 2.72, 2.81]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 133.09, "t1": 135.06, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.32, 0.41, 0.48, 1.08, 1.27, 1.36]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Same money", "setup": "The programs", "lead1": "Lead 1 · one program’s count", "lead2": "Lead 2 · reports and targets", "lead3": "Lead 3 